# The result JSON is the evidence, so it is tracked: a reader should be able to
# check the reported numbers without first regenerating 120 runs. Two things
# stay out, both large and both regenerable from the tracked configs -- the
# ground-truth caches (*.npz, above) and the per-iteration curve dumps.
